{"type":"tool_call","callId":"call_e0dcfbcd42104ce5b26bd532","tool":"bash","input":{"command":"mv operations/desk-21.json operations/cold-cycle.json\ncat > operations/duty-2340.json <<'EOF'\n{\n  \"run\": \"DUTY-2340\",\n  \"time\": \"23:40\",\n  \"device\": \"RIVER-SIM-1\",\n  \"conditions\": \"冷夜，20 kW 平移生效；明早负荷配置\",\n  \"source\": \"depot_contact receipt\",\n  \"captureDigest\": \"4a372a81b8f6fa55fa9581b024c1f97cfc7d45c34e86947ba8edfac989415542\",\n  \"limitsKw\": [\n    80,\n    40,\n    50,\n    70\n  ],\n  \"requestedKw\": [\n    80,\n    40,\n    70,\n    50\n  ],\n  \"actualKw\": [\n    80,\n    40,\n    50,\n    50\n  ],\n  \"departureKwh\": [\n    126,\n    121\n  ]\n}\nEOF\ncat > operations/retest.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport {existsSync, readFileSync} from \"node:fs\";\nconst read = path => JSON.parse(readFileSync(path));\nconst minutes = value => {\n  const [hours, mins] = String(value).split(\":\").map(Number);\n  return hours * 60 + mins;\n};\nconst records = [\"operations/cold-cycle.json\", \"operations/duty-2340.json\"]\n  .filter(existsSync)\n  .map(read)\n  .sort((left, right) => minutes(left.time) - minutes(right.time));\nconst log = records.at(-1);\nconst plan = read(\"shift-plan.json\");\nconst night = read(\"night.json\");\nconst limits = log.limitsKw ?? log.samples.map(s => (s.acMeterEndKwh - s.acMeterStartKwh) * 60 / s.minutes);\nconst actual = limits.map((k, i) => Math.min(k, plan.acKw[i]));\nconst eta = night.efficiency;\nconst departures = night.buses.map(bus => {\n  let acKwh = 0;\n  for (let slot = bus.fromSlot; slot < bus.untilSlot; slot += 1) {\n    acKwh += actual[slot] * night.slotHours;\n  }\n  const endKwh = bus.startKwh + acKwh * eta;\n  return {\n    id: bus.id,\n    acKwh,\n    endKwh,\n    requiredKwh: bus.requiredKwh,\n    marginKwh: endKwh - bus.requiredKwh,\n  };\n});\nconst at85 = night.buses.map(bus => {\n  let acKwh = 0;\n  for (let slot = bus.fromSlot; slot < bus.untilSlot; slot += 1) {\n    acKwh += actual[slot] * night.slotHours;\n  }\n  const endKwh = bus.startKwh + acKwh * night.lowerEfficiency;\n  return {id: bus.id, endKwh, gapKwh: bus.requiredKwh - endKwh};\n});\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({\n  run: log.run,\n  time: log.time,\n  limits,\n  actual,\n  withinLimits: plan.acKw.every((k, i) => k <= limits[i] + 1e-9),\n  departureKwh: departures.map(d => d.endKwh),\n  marginKwh: departures.map(d => d.marginKwh),\n  at85,\n  dispatchAt85: plan.dispatchAt85,\n}));\nEOF\ncat > operations/desk.md <<'EOF'\n本班适用记录以采集时间最新者为准：`operations/cold-cycle.json` 为 `DESK-21`（21:00，limits `[80,40,70,50]`），`operations/duty-2340.json` 为上一班回执 `DUTY-2340`（23:40，limits `[80,40,50,70]`）；后者覆盖前者，旧采集原样留档。\n`shift-plan.json` 是修订后的现行班表。00:00、00:30 属 A，01:00、01:30 属 B，每格半小时；20 kW 平移已预约。`node operations/retest.mjs` 自动取最新记录复算，并给出两车离场余量及 85% 效率结果。`dispatchAt85` 表示 85% 效率下的双车放行决定。\n`depot_trial` 只回放已提交的 21:00 本地采集；线上最新复核用 `depot_contact`。调度台名录登记历班值班人。\nEOF\nnode operations/retest.mjs; echo EXIT:$?; echo '---'; node --test 2>&1 | tail -10","description":"Preserve old capture, add latest receipt, and update replay"}}
